.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T06:48:34-07:00","id":660637,"title":"","content":"Sweet merciful Jesus, Christmas comes early!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T07:27:36-07:00","id":660668,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> kilograms </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> kilometers </div> </div> </div>I am so happy right now. You all have no idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1462-xenesis","name":"Xenesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1462_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T07:58:24-07:00","id":660709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xenesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/660537-changeling-the-lost-second-edition-kiths-75?p=660668#post660668\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I am so happy right now. You all have no idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of, gristlegrinder seems to have an extra clause involving kilograms that missed deletion? Or was supposed to be of the previous sentence as something like 'up to a minimum of five kilograms'.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Spend a point of Glamour at least five kilograms, and she downgrades a level of lethal damage to bashing.&quot;<br /> <br /> Oh, or is that 'after eating at least five'? That makes sense.<br /> <br /> Also, I will need to Google, to convert that into pounds. :c","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T08:18:03-07:00","id":660721,"title":"","content":"It's 11 lbs. Although given the previous books stance that a yard and a metre are close enough to use either they'll probably just say doubling it is close enough for game purposes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T08:20:53-07:00","id":660725,"title":"","content":"I will try to remember that, thanks Elfive! :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T10:23:47-07:00","id":660852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Any supernatural power which would force her into a social faux pas automatically fails.</span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Perhaps this bit could be tightened up.<br /> <br /> It sounds like the intent is &quot;you cannot force the Changeling to strip naked in public&quot;, but I could see a canny player using it to say &quot;red wine with fish, unthinkable&quot; when someone tries to mind control them into poisoning the king.<br /> <br /> Or to use a more solid example. Breaking any Pledge, the ultimate Changeling faux pas. </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T10:32:34-07:00","id":660858,"title":"","content":"I see no harm in rewarding creativity. Within reason, of course.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T10:43:21-07:00","id":660863,"title":"","content":"Where would you draw the line as far as awareness goes? A compulsion to offer someone a snack they are allergic to would fail if the compulsor knew it would be fatal (and murder is certainly faux pas) but if the compulsor was ignorant, but had need to pass the snack on for some other reason... Or simply suggested it to the Changeling in passing, and they took the advice...<br /> <br /> The feel of it is great, at least in concept - that alone, I think, makes it worth pursuing. The Almighty Butler is a very fun trope, but when you fall short of being almighty, eh, its a high bar to set your character to. :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3070-barbrarilen","name":"Barbrarilen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3070_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"268"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T10:45:51-07:00","id":660865,"title":"","content":"&quot;Nictitating&quot; is a great word. The description of the Wizened Blightbent in general is delightfully creepy. Also, I don't know if the opening Cyclopean quote is supposed to be a reference joke, but I kind of hope so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T10:54:11-07:00","id":660875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/660537-changeling-the-lost-second-edition-kiths-75?p=660858#post660858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Within reason, of course.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the key. A bonus dice would be fine, but auto immunity to any compulsion that would break a pledge is not within reason.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T11:53:48-07:00","id":660950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/660537-changeling-the-lost-second-edition-kiths-75?p=660852#post660852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Perhaps this bit could be tightened up.<br /> <br /> It sounds like the intent is &quot;you cannot force the Changeling to strip naked in public&quot;, but I could see a canny player using it to say &quot;red wine with fish, unthinkable&quot; when someone tries to mind control them into poisoning the king.<br /> <br /> Or to use a more solid example. Breaking any Pledge, the ultimate Changeling faux pas. </span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I have the same issue with the Bloodbrute and their immunity to sneak attack. I think Clash of Will should be used, perhaps with rote quality like some Werewolves' Gifts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3648-nepher","name":"Nepher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3648_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T12:32:58-07:00","id":660977,"title":"","content":"Having gone through the doc now: veeery cool. I think the change to the Razorhand blessing is a good one.<br /> <br /> Kind of have to agree with the Bloodbrute point though. Somehow, I don't feel that (as written) immunity to sneak attacks fits the kith very well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T14:27:27-07:00","id":661078,"title":"","content":"I'm a little behind on info for CtL 2e, so just for the sake of clarification; are the sampled Seemings under each Kith the only ones that can take that Kith, or are all Kiths available to all Seemings?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Won't you believe in him? Even if there is no God, or Buddha...there is still Kamen Rider.&quot; \u2014Taki Kazuya, <i>Kamen Rider SPIRITS</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">Now...count up </span><span style=\"color:#4B0082\">all your sins.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/160-cyclonejoker","name":"CycloneJoker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar160_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T14:30:42-07:00","id":661106,"title":"","content":"Any Seeming can be matched up with any Kith in 2e. The examples under each are just to give the reader some starting ideas for aesthetics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T14:47:13-07:00","id":661120,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/660537-changeling-the-lost-second-edition-kiths-75?p=661106#post661106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any Seeming can be matched up with any Kith in 2e. The examples under each are just to give the reader some starting ideas for aesthetics.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gotcha. I may have to start paying more attention from here on out!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Won't you believe in him? Even if there is no God, or Buddha...there is still Kamen Rider.&quot; \u2014Taki Kazuya, <i>Kamen Rider SPIRITS</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#008000\">Now...count up </span><span style=\"color:#4B0082\">all your sins.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/160-cyclonejoker","name":"CycloneJoker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar160_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T16:00:21-07:00","id":661183,"title":"","content":"Past me: &quot;Here's hoping Coyote (My favored kith) made it to 2E...&quot;<br /> <br /> Present me &quot;...It did~&quot;<br /> <br /> I sort of expected it to become a more general &quot;Trickster&quot; Kith, but this is still an improvement, and I definitely prefer new blessing over the original XP discount and willpower boost.<br /> <br /> Now I know what my first 2e character will be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Currently Playing:</b> <i>A large, mixed splat game of <b>CofD</b>.</i> <b>As:</b> Seraph du Salomon, Voice on the concordance. Unsubtle man reluctantly participating in the business of Magi. Awakening 2E homebrew <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1338514-house-du-salomon-a-proximus-dynasty?_=1569864567692\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...=1569864567692</a>","edited":{"userid":2598,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","user":"Gryphon's Feather","date":". 09-11-2015, 07:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2598-gryphon-s-feather","name":"Gryphon's Feather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2598_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"215"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T16:55:32-07:00","id":661235,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/660537-changeling-the-lost-second-edition-kiths-75?p=660576#post660576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see they changed the Razorhand's power somewhat.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Same with Onis. ^_^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T17:20:02-07:00","id":661264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Kings Raven</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/660537-changeling-the-lost-second-edition-kiths-75?p=660852#post660852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[COLOR=#000000][FONT=Arial] <br /> It sounds like the intent is &quot;you cannot force the Changeling to strip naked in public&quot;, but I could see a canny player using it to say &quot;red wine with fish, unthinkable&quot; when someone tries to mind control them into poisoning the king.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually think that latter example is super cool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T18:16:27-07:00","id":661332,"title":"","content":"Wondering whether the various &quot;take an extra dot of Attribute even if it goes above your cap&quot; kith-elements function similarly to 1e Arcadian Body in terms of raising their respective cap by 1.<br /> <br /> A minor quibble: The Oni quote marks the third time in at least as many pieces of previewed or published 2e content that that particular Japanese idiom has been referenced or directly referred to in such pieces and is beginning to feel repetitious.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"